    "# PLRS — SAKTWithDecay Training on OULAD\n",
    "\n",
    "**Goal:** Train `SAKTWithDecay` (Ebbinghaus forgetting curve decay) on the OULAD dataset and push the best checkpoint to HuggingFace Hub.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Target:** Val AUC ≥ 0.785 (baseline: 0.7692 with vanilla SAKT)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Works on:** Google Colab (free T4 GPU) or Kaggle Notebooks\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "### What this notebook does\n",
    "1. Installs dependencies\n",
    "2. Loads OULAD data (from Kaggle dataset or Google Drive)\n",
    "3. Preprocesses: joins `studentVle.csv` + `vle.csv` + `studentAssessment.csv` → `(student_id, skill_id, correct, timestamp)` sequences\n",
    "4. Trains `SAKTWithDecay` with early stopping\n",
    "5. Trains vanilla `SAKTModel` as a comparison baseline\n",
    "6. Evaluates both models and prints AUC comparison table\n",
    "7. Pushes the best `sakt_decay_best.pt` to `Clementio/PLRS` on HuggingFace Hub\n",
    "8. Rebuilds `skill_encoder_v2.csv` from real OULAD `vle.csv` activity types\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "**⚡ Runtime:** ~30–60 min on Colab T4 GPU. Set `Runtime → Change runtime type → GPU` before starting."
   ]
  },
