    "## 3. OULAD Preprocessing\n",
    "\n",
    "**What we're building:** `(student_id, skill_id, correct, timestamp)` interaction sequences.\n",
    "\n",
    "**The join logic:**\n",
    "- `vle.csv` maps `id_site → activity_type + code_module + code_presentation`\n",
    "- `studentVle.csv` — VLE engagement events per student per resource per date\n",
    "- `assessments.csv` — assessment metadata: `id_assessment, code_module, code_presentation, date`\n",
    "- `studentAssessment.csv` — per-student per-assessment scores\n",
    "\n",
    "**Correctness encoding (no leakage):**  \n",
    "Each VLE interaction is assigned the score from the **nearest upcoming assessment** in the same module/presentation. `correct = 1 if score >= 50`. This is a time-aware, interaction-level label — not a global student average.\n"
   ]
